{"id":"0d590602754bbccc","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-inf-tot-isomorphism.md","title":"Inf 与 Tot 的可计算同构","display":"thm-inf-tot-isomorphism — Inf 与 Tot 的可计算同构","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-inf-tot-isomorphism","aliases":["20-thm-inf-tot-isomorphism"],"display":"thm-inf-tot-isomorphism — Inf 与 Tot 的可计算同构","chapter":"4","section":"4.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.3.2","source_printed_pages":[86],"source_pdf_pages":[122],"depends_on":["[[20-df-inf]]","[[20-df-totex]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-lem-padding]]","[[20-thm-myhill-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-inf-tot-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-inf-tot-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-inf-tot-isomorphism — Inf 与 Tot 的可计算同构"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>86</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>122</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"574494b7c7eef96a\" href=\"?note=574494b7c7eef96a\" title=\"20-df-inf\">20-df-inf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4b3a00f06ef7edb\" href=\"?note=f4b3a00f06ef7edb\" title=\"20-df-totex\">20-df-totex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" href=\"?note=50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" title=\"20-thm-myhill-isomorphism\">20-thm-myhill-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inf}\">\\(\\mathrm{Inf}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tot}\\)</span> 采用同一标准部分程序域编号。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"574494b7c7eef96a\" href=\"?note=574494b7c7eef96a\" title=\"20-df-inf\">20-df-inf</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f4b3a00f06ef7edb\" href=\"?note=f4b3a00f06ef7edb\" title=\"20-df-totex\">20-df-totex</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" href=\"?note=50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" title=\"20-thm-myhill-isomorphism\">20-thm-myhill-isomorphism</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inf-tot-isomorphism}\\vdash\\mathrm{Inf}\\equiv_1\\mathrm{Tot}\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathrm{Inf}\\cong_c\\mathrm{Tot}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inf-tot-isomorphism}\\vdash\\mathrm{Inf}\\equiv_1\\mathrm{Tot}\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathrm{Inf}\\cong_c\\mathrm{Tot}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Inf 到 Tot：给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，新程序在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 出现至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u+1\">\\(u+1\\)</span> 个不同成员后停止；它全定义恰当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 无限。Tot 到 Inf：新程序在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 等待所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\le u\">\\(v\\le u\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(v)\">\\(\\varphi_e(v)\\)</span> 停止后停止；若原程序全则新域整集，否则新域有限初段。两种指标转换由 s-m-n 和 padding 单射化。Myhill 定理据此给普通可计算置换。此结论强于 Turing 度相等，两个单射归约分别明确构造。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 86 / PDF 122。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-inf","status":"resolved","id":"574494b7c7eef96a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-inf]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-totex","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3a00f06ef7edb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-totex]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-padding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-myhill-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"50ca9db6cf8f4a12","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-myhill-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-inf","status":"resolved","id":"574494b7c7eef96a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]